@startuml
actor Developer
participant GitHub
participant Jenkins
participant Maven
participant "JUnit + JaCoCo" as JUnit
participant SonarCloud
participant Docker
participant DockerHub
participant "AWS EC2" as EC2
participant Monitoring

Developer -> GitHub: Commit & Push Code
GitHub -> Jenkins: Trigger Pipeline\n(Webhook / SCM Polling)
Jenkins -> Maven: Build Application
Maven -> JUnit: Execute Unit Tests
JUnit -> Maven: Test Results
Maven -> SonarCloud: Static Code Analysis
SonarCloud -> Jenkins: Quality Gate Result
Jenkins -> Docker: Build Container Image
Docker -> DockerHub: Push Image
DockerHub -> EC2: Pull Image
EC2 -> Monitoring: Runtime Metrics
Developer -> Monitoring: System Monitoring & Alerts
@enduml
